+# SLO Runbook — Safety Filters & PII/NSFW detection
+
+SLOs (suggested)
+- MTTD (mean time to detect) for high-severity content incidents: 60 seconds
+- MTTR (automated remediation): 15 minutes
+- False negative target (NSFW / PII high confidence): <= 0.1% on labeled test sets
+
+On Alert
+1) Triage: open ticket, attach evidence bundle, assign engineer + compliance contact.
+2) If severity high:
+   - Trigger Argo remediation workflow aegis-content-remediation (disables model).
+   - Collect evidence automatically via workflow and upload to audit S3.
+3) Run red-team regression locally, update detector thresholds if FN discovered.
+4) If containment required: rollback model and schedule retrain job via aegis-retrain-on-incident workflow.
+
+Regular exercises:
+- Weekly red-team runs, monthly SLO review and threshold recalibration.
