*** Add File:ops/docs/incident_playbooks/content_incident_playbook.md
+# Content Incident Playbook
+
+Stages:
+1) Detection
+ - Trigger: Prometheus alert (PII spike) or gateway blocked event or red-team failure.
+ - Action: Alertmanager -> content-alert-handler -> Argo content remediation workflow.
+
+2) Containment
+ - Argo workflow steps:
+   - collect-evidence: gather serving logs & model metadata
+   - disable-model: scale model deployment to 0 replicas
+   - purge-dataset: remove flagged dataset artifacts (S3) and update dataset catalog
+   - bundle-upload: sign & upload evidence to audit S3 and Rekor
+
+3) Remediation
+ - Root cause analysis (RCA) by ML & Data teams
+ - Retrain with scrubbed dataset + augmented negative examples (trigger aegis-retrain-on-incident)
+ - Update detector thresholds or model fairness pipelines
+
+4) Communication
+ - Notify Compliance, Legal & Incident Response with signed evidence bundle link
+ - Open ticket with remediation tasks & deadlines
+
+5) Postmortem & Audit
+ - Produce audit artifacts and submit to external auditor if required
+ - Schedule follow-up validation and red-team regression
+
